Source: https://github.com/catppuccin/fzf/blob/7508f8141286fb95249100a2b5325960320dcf32/themes/catppuccin-fzf-mocha.rc
License source: https://github.com/catppuccin/fzf/blob/7508f8141286fb95249100a2b5325960320dcf32/LICENSE

fzf-catppuccin-mocha.opts is the unchanged official Catppuccin Mocha fzf
options file, not the differently colored preset from the fzf author's site.
No shell code, layout or key bindings are imported. selected-bg requires fzf
0.52.0 or newer, checked during resolution and again before applying.
Compatibility source: https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/blob/0.52.0/CHANGELOG.md

